    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Justina Labelle",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103856168847589978339/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVlul-Ip3PkdhKhy9TXNb1GAmX-yJGjjaFfmT1aH6FNZyzeZlJh=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I LOVE EVERYTHING about this library! The study space upstairs and the private rooms are excellent. It is clean, modern, and spacious. Books are in English and French. They have a manifold of objects and games to rent. The selection of DVDs are amazing, the DVD rentals include modern machines and the front desk staff are incredibly helpful. It is just immaculate! A must see and visit! ❤️❤️",
        "time": 1765648595,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Edouard PAHUD",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107980668081129286057/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKuDM0gEUBarVv-swuF4DryymQwgDWqUqKml9aOgCjdnKI5EA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Beautiful place and new technology however I would have preferred a new pool which was originally planned for the building",
        "time": 1759668804,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Georgi Stanchev",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104240510363903043936/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWlzT39Q15bnGV0NGxKZsghwC-gE6MlatcwjPIxSb7kX7Aq08k=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "As I was leaving, I passed the front desk and a group of women started saying 'Elle est jolie' —and I am a man! Come on. I have nothing against their sexuality; I think it is great, but it has no place in the workplace.",
        "time": 1767032677,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "F.N. M.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103863523798550029750/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWULDHvZEe9Z6mrvXiERfsCuSbDf_InN_gpbQXc-uvjY4lZJkzQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "My kids (10 and 7) adore coming to this library and now that they’ve moved to a bigger more open space, they love coming here even more. I don’t mind driving my kids here to pick up books or video games. The staff are very friendly and helpful with my kids. And the new way to return and check-out books is totally awesome. My kids and I feel like we’re in downtown Montreal when we visit the new building. So airy and spacious. Lots of space to ride and park your bike too. The only I find annoying are the tight parking spaces where you need to back-in emit you have a large SUV or minivan. Wish they can make their parking lots like Costco with the double lines and enough space to open your door without hitting cars next to you. Other than the parking, it’s a beautiful building.",
        "time": 1749547575,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Johnson Kix",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107811651662457762812/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIf5Qmpl_2DjBj7DOZ3DhoDNykiT8NeYiDa606X_8z9DOYIoQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I recently visited this library and had an outstanding experience. The staff are incredibly friendly and helpful, making it a welcoming environment. A special shoutout to Yassin, who went above and beyond to assist me and show me around. His guidance made my visit smooth and enjoyable. I highly recommend this library to anyone looking for a pleasant and supportive place to read, study, or just relax with a good book.",
        "time": 1720456643,
        "translated": false
      }
